Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Une seule famille\Nallait survivre.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.45,0:00:04.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Et elle ne le\Nsavait pas encore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.54,0:00:08.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Le Très-Haut\Nenvoya Uriel auprès
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:09.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}du fils de Lamech,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}un homme juste\Nnommé Noé.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.48,0:00:17.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Un ange, au\Nmilieu de la nuit,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:19.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}sur le seuil\Nde sa porte.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:21.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Noé se demanda\Ns'il rêvait encore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:22.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}« Cache-toi »,\Ndit l'ange.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.88,0:00:27.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}« La fin approche.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.37,0:00:29.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Toute la Terre\Nva périr. »
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.22,0:00:30.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Noé pensa\Nà sa femme,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.74,0:00:30.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}à ses fils…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.74,0:00:32.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}et serra les poings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:40.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}« Un déluge va venir\Nsur toute la Terre,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.33,0:00:42.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}et tout ce qui s'y\Ntrouve sera détruit. »
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.87,0:00:50.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}« Je t'apprendrai\Ncomment échapper,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.68,0:00:51.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}afin que ta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.27,0:00:53.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}descendance\Ndemeure. »
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.63,0:00:53.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Noé,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.82,0:00:56.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}qui n'avait jamais\Nconstruit de bateau,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.51,0:00:58.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}prit une grande\Ninspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.56,0:01:05.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Noé leva les yeux.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:07.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Le ciel\Ns'assombrissait…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.22,0:01:08.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}et la première\Ngoutte tomba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.41,0:01:19.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Ainsi s'achève\Nl'histoire
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:21.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}des Veilleurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.41,0:01:22.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Mais le Livre\Nd'Hénoch n'a pas
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.86,0:01:24.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}encore livré tous\Nses secrets.
